! TRCALL.DBG - stepping traced calls (part C): STEP/INTO a traced
! CALLS, the RET that ends the tracing, then STEP/OVER of the CALLS
! whose routine sets T in its frame, and of the JSB.
SET STEP INSTRUCTION
SET BREAK C2
GO
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP/INTO
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
SET BREAK C6
GO
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE TCOUNT
GO
